  | ^^^^^^^^ outside a loop
  |
  = help: use it in the body of a `for` loop

## loop_variable_is_a_core_name (exit 1)
error[Z0105]: `print` is a name of `core` and cannot be rebound
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:5
  |
1 | for print in 1..2 {
  |     ^^^^^ a built-in name
  |
  = help: choose another name; the names of `core` are fixed

